<title>USA: National City to buyback up to 5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>National City to buyback up to 5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>National City Corp Monday said it plans to repurchase of up to five million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The share repurchase will enable the firm to acquire, in the open market or otherwise, up to five million shares of its stock, subject to a purchase limit of $275 million.</p>
<p>All repurchased shares will be held as Treasury shares for reissue in connection with the company's dividend reinvestment and stock option plans, and for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
